name 'designing-reliable-apps-postassessment-q10_2026'

question 'A developer\'s app fetches product data, which arrives successfully. However, the data includes "price": "nineteen dollars" instead of a number, and the app breaks when calculating a discount. Which type of failure does this represent?'

wrong 'A server failure — the server sent the wrong type of response'
wrong 'A network failure — the data was corrupted during transmission'
wrong 'A Promise rejection — the fetch returned a rejected state due to the unexpected format'
right 'An invalid data error — the data arrived successfully but does not match the expected format or type'

allow_multiple_attempts true

